# Agents multi-rôles — Velyon

Les personas sont dans `.cursor/agents/`. Invoque-les via Task/subagent ou en chargeant le fichier agent.

| Besoin | Agent typique |
|--------|----------------|
| Feature transverse | `velyon-coordinator` |
| Specs SDD métier | `spec-velyon-writer`, `spec-sdd-orchestrator` |
| PDF brand book / Playwright | `pdf-brand-book-specialist` + skill `stack-pdf-playwright` |
| Logos / SVG / variantes | `logo-assets-specialist` |
| Palette / contrastes WCAG | `color-contrast-specialist` |
| Polices / échelle typo | `font-typography-specialist` |
| Design tokens export | `design-tokens-specialist` |
| Stripe / freemium | `stripe-billing-specialist` |
| Next.js / UI | `nextjs-developer`, `frontend-developer`, `ui-designer` |
| Prisma / Postgres | `postgres-pro`, `database-administrator` |
| Sécurité | `security-auditor` |
| Tests unitaires | `unit-test-engineer` |
| E2E Playwright | `e2e-playwright-tester` + `playwright-cli` |
| Charge / perf | `load-performance-tester` |
| A11y | `accessibility-tester` + `accessibilite-a11y` |
| QA globale | `qa-expert` |
| Doc HTML racine | `documentation-engineer` + `documentation-html` |
| Review | `code-reviewer` |
| Orchestration multi-tâches | `multi-agent-coordinator` |

Priorité : skills process (Speckit / brainstorming) → agents domaine Velyon → implémentation.
